+\end{lemma}
+
+\begin{proof}
+
+\leanok
+For each \(s\le t\), the triangle inequality gives
+\[
+  \|A_s(\omega)-Z(\omega)\|_e
+  \le \|A_s(\omega)\|_e+\|Z(\omega)\|_e .
